# Cursor AI Rules — UFL Fantasy Football Draft Advisor

- Refer to `AGENTS.md` for complete architecture, rules, and subsystem contracts.
- UFL Scoring Math: Rushing & Receiving = 0.20 pts/yd (1 pt per 5 yds). 0.3 PPR. Passing = 0.04 pts/yd, 4 pt Pass TD, -2 INT.
- Target Window: Q1 (Weeks 1-4).
- 6-Team Snake Draft Matrix (12 rounds, 72 picks).
- Use `streamlit run app.py` to run dashboard.
- Run `python test_system.py` to execute system verification suite.
